{"unit_id":"Juntiantan__dsh-permission-gate#card-zh","repo":"Juntiantan/dsh-permission-gate","commit":"be80659d0195d859691e140d095bcf2e3b0f715c","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-permission-gate（DSH 插件，网页客户端）：为 DSH 网页和 agent 工具调用提供共享会话锁。它通过页面注入显示登录界面，并在宿主侧拦截工具调用。主要功能包括设置访问口令、登录解锁、按空闲时间锁定、跨页面共享登录状态，以及在设置页管理闸门。适合希望在 DSH 网页使用会话锁定和工具调用控制的用户。需要在运行 DSH 的主机保存本地凭据文件。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:301-341","lib/client.js:235-247"]}
{"unit_id":"Juntiantan__dsh-permission-gate#card-en","repo":"Juntiantan/dsh-permission-gate","commit":"be80659d0195d859691e140d095bcf2e3b0f715c","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-permission-gate (DSH web plugin) adds password login, shared sessions, and idle locking. It injects a login interface and guards agent tool calls until a session is unlocked. A Settings page shows status and password-protected controls. Credentials are stored locally on the DSH host.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:301-341","lib/client.js:235-247"]}
