{"unit_id":"Juntiantan__dsh-permission-gate#feature-1","repo":"Juntiantan/dsh-permission-gate","commit":"be80659d0195d859691e140d095bcf2e3b0f715c","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-permission-gate 的功能「共享会话」：登录状态由宿主进程维护，页面轮询同一状态；登录解锁后各页面同步显示，并共用一个空闲计时。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:55-57","lib/index.js:112-133"]}
